style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">根據勞動部截至今年<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">6</span>月中旬統計顯示，足額提撥舊制勞工退休準備金的事業單位已達<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">97.7</span>％，未足額提撥的事業單位中以製造業最多，以事業單位規模來看，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">5</span>人以下佔<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">72.4</span>％。</font></span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">&nbsp;</font></span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">按勞基法規定，雇主除了每個月為舊制勞工提撥退休準備金外，必須在每年的年底預估下一個年度達到退休條件的勞工所需退休金，並在次年<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">3</span>月底前補足其差額。</font></span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">&nbsp;</font></span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">根據勞動統計資料，現在適用舊制勞退的事業單位計有<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">9</span>萬<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">8</span>千多家，截至今年<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">6</span>月中旬，已經符合規定足額提撥舊制勞工退休準備金的事業單位達<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">9</span>萬<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">6</span>千多家，佔全部<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">97.7%</span>；未足額提撥的事業單位規模<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">30</span>人以下佔<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">94.3%</span>，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">5</span>人以下達<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">72.4%</span>。</font></span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">&nbsp;</font></span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: b